Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:08.40,ED-ja,原文,0,0,0,,{\c&HECCD5C&}そうさ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:08.40,ED-zh,译文,0,0,0,,{\c&HECCD5C&}没错啊
